<title>NETHERLANDS: BIOGROND FIRST-HALF NET PER SHARE UP.</title>
<headline>BIOGROND FIRST-HALF NET PER SHARE UP.</headline>
<dateline>ZEIST, Netherlands 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1996</p>
<p>(in guilders)</p>
<p>    Net per shr			    0.14  vs   0.13</p>
<p>    Net profit			   231,000 vs 267,000</p>
<p>    Total income			 330,000 vs 377,000</p>
<p>    Total costs			   99,000 vs 110,000</p>
<p>NOTE - Green investment fund Biogrond NV stopped issuing</p>
<p>shares in December 1995 but continued buying back its own</p>
<p>shares. The fund said it expected profits to remain steady in</p>
<p>the second half of 1996.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
